      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "1 Knowing that the Government is one of the 2 largest issuers of credit card receipts, one would have 3 to wonder why they would want to exclude the Government 4 in terms of protecting the public."
    },
    {
